          {
            "title": "Question: Multiple Parameters",
            "id": 87278,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist falsch an diesem Code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item_1, item_2, item_3, item_4, item_5)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = item_1 + item_2 + item_3 + item_4 + item_5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cart = get_total(\" /><text value=\"5.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"74.5\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Es gibt nichts Falsches am Code</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>get_total</code> ist kein Funktionsname</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktion hat keine <code>return</code>-Anweisung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Es gibt nichts Falsches am Code.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum zeigt dieser Code <code>74.5</code> an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"get_total\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(item_1, item_2, item_3, item_4, item_5)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  total = item_1 + item_2 + item_3 + item_4 + item_5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cart = get_total(\" /><text value=\"5.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(cart)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"74.5\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die Funktion addiert alle fünf Argumentwerte und gibt die Summe an <code>cart</code> zurück.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktion ignoriert <code>5.5</code>, weil es keine Ganzzahl ist.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die Funktion zeigt die Summe an, ohne einen Wert zurückzugeben.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die Funktion addiert alle fünf Argumentwerte und gibt die Summe an <code>cart</code> zurück.</p></body></html>"
