            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Kopf sollte die erste Zeile ersetzen, damit die Funktion beide Werte erhalten kann?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"def\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"calculate_sum\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(num_1; num_2)\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(num_1 + num_2)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"calculate_sum(\" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>def calculate_sum(num_1, num_2):</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>def calculate_sum(num_1; num_2):</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>def calculate_sum(num_1 num_2):</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>def calculate_sum(num_1, num_2):</code>.</p></body></html>"
